(10.0.2.x)

Private VM has:
- No public IP
- No direct internet exposure

---

# How Private Subnet Application is Exposed

Applications in private subnet cannot be accessed directly from internet.

We expose using:

| Method | Purpose |
|---------|----------|
| Application Gateway | Layer 7 routing |
| Load Balancer | Layer 4 routing |
| Reverse Proxy | Application exposure |
| VPN/Bastion | Admin access |

---

# Recommended Architecture

Internet
   |
Application Gateway
(Public IP)
   |
Private VM
(Application)

