# Real Interview Explanation

“We created a VNet with CIDR 10.0.0.0/16 and divided it into public and private subnets. Public subnet resources are exposed using public IPs and NSG rules. Private subnet resources are exposed securely through Application Gateway or Load Balancer. NAT Gateway is attached to the private subnet to provide secure outbound internet connectivity without exposing the VM directly to the internet.”
